# Third-party material that must never enter this repo's history.
# This repo is public, so anything listed here would be world-readable if committed.
# - Curriculum PDFs from Hannah: an active study is running on these activities;
#   she asked that they not be shared or put on any public-facing service.
# - LbyM source from Jeffery (web app and the Arduino driver): their code, shared
#   for reference only because Troy did not want to add outside accounts to their
#   GitLab.
# - The STEMACES kit contents list: program material, not ours to publish.
# Keep all of it out of git, out of any published artifact, and local to this
# machine. Docs may cite these paths; they are local-only by design.
